(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-75","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["叶澄说自己当年的[[conceit|自负]]在于相信只要工程完工，就能修补一切。车站有[[concentrated|集中的]]样品接收室，她把签字的[[confirmation|确认]]与实货[[conformity|符合]]当作同一件事。面对面的[[confrontation|对质]]让她很累，外国捐赠[[consul|领事]]的旧落款并不能[[contain|控制]]混装。山城样品的[[contamination|污染]]风险尚待鉴定，经理却露出[[contemptuous|轻蔑的]]笑，说离岛就回了安全[[continent|大陆]]。所谓[[continental|大陆的]]转运条件若仍靠同一张改签纸，海岸也不会自动把危险留在身后。叶澄低头，不再用已经完成的工程作答。","我们必须[[continue|继续]]看她签后的动作。基金[[contrived|人为编造的]]统一表已用来[[control|控制]]出货。叶澄与司机[[converse|交谈]]，听见自己没有做的[[correction|订正]]变成一条通行线。只会[[correctly|正确地]]算尺寸不够；她坐到[[couch|长沙发]]，压下[[cough|咳嗽]]，车站[[counseling|咨询服务]]员给她留了水。货检员调出[[x-ray|X光]]安检影像，只确认内部形状与新工具清单不同，不代替化学检验。那张影像让叶澄停在杯沿的手慢慢放下，箱里原来真的还留着她以为已经退走的部件。","司机很[[courteous|有礼]]，门外[[cricket|蟋蟀]]声却使沉默更长。叶澄原怕停工造成[[crippling|严重的]]损失，所以降低验收[[criteria|标准]]；她不能因基金后来做法[[crooked|不正的]]就缩掉自己的半步。铁道旁一只[[crow|乌鸦]]停在灯上，箱子按[[cubic|立方的]]体积计费。一名[[curly|卷发的]]搬运员说[[currently|目前]]货已排下一趟车。经理[[curt|生硬的]]答复是每天都这样。老陈让她拿[[daily|每日的]]交接，不让‘每天’成为一张可以覆盖不同箱号的空白票。叶澄开始逐项确认自己当日实际在场的环节。","有的人不[[dare|敢]]问，有的人把不问当成[[daring|大胆的]]赶工。列车轰鸣几乎[[deafen|震聋]]我，旧箱里可[[decompose|分解]]的包装却一直换成[[decorative|装饰性的]]新壳。改签会[[deepen|加深]]错觉，不能当叶澄的[[defence|辩护]]。早验页明确写着清洁记录[[deficient|不足]]，她后来试图[[deflect|转移]]问题。运输碰撞会[[deform|使变形]]箱扣，[[deformation|变形]]照片与岛站同角匹配。我们把旧照片和货检影像分开注明，前者只能认外箱，后者只能看形状；两种有限东西接在一起，才比她一句‘以为’更有分量。","外壳的[[degradation|退化]]被隐瞒，原应[[delay|延缓]]的交接便一路提前。办公室[[deliberately|故意地]]遮掉那字，宣传仍说受助者充满[[delight|喜悦]]。叶澄当年曾[[deliver|交付]]这个签字，她的责任不能[[depend|取决于]]后来别人是否更坏。站方开始[[deploy|配置]]检查人员，暂停特定批次，再安排另车接正常粮食。吴老师得知学生饭仍到，说今晚不用打电话请家属补钱。事情在这一刻不只有一条被拦住的路，还有一条被人认真接上的路。叶澄把那杯水喝完，要求补记自己当年接到修改通知的时间。","何警官接收完整说明后，赵启对比旧港承包运输印，发现提前验收页早被复制到基金中央入库册。入库册的批次尾号与岛站原表相同，但改印时间先于叶澄知道被改的电话。司机承认收到过带该页影像的放行消息，愿意提供原手机供登记提取。我们没有拿手机在手里乱翻。程雾记录他自愿交出的经过，叶澄在旁把放行日期圈出来，说那天自己就在办公室，却没有进去问。我忽然知道下一步不在她能否痛快认错，而在那扇办公室门后是谁实际让车走。明早查中央册的出库联，实箱仍在站方看守下。"],"en":["Ye's old [[conceit|conceit]] was believing finished works could repair everything. At a [[concentrated|concentrated]] receiving room she confused signature [[confirmation|confirmation]] with cargo [[conformity|conformity]]. [[confrontation|Confrontation]] exhausted her; a donor [[consul|consul]]'s signature could not [[contain|contain]] mixing. Possible [[contamination|contamination]] awaited examination. A [[contemptuous|contemptuous]] manager said we had reached the safe [[continent|continent]]. But [[continental|continental]] conditions relying on altered forms could not automatically leave risks at sea. Ye lowered her eyes and stopped offering completed engineering as an answer.","We must [[continue|continue]] through her subsequent actions. A [[contrived|contrived]] common form exercised [[control|control]] over dispatch. As she began to [[converse|converse]] with the driver, an unmade [[correction|correction]] became a route. Calculating [[correctly|correctly]] was insufficient. On a [[couch|couch]], suppressing a [[cough|cough]], she accepted water from [[counseling|counseling]] staff. Cargo [[x-ray|X-ray]] images showed shapes unlike the new tool list, not chemical findings. Her hand lowered slowly: components she believed returned remained inside. We did not let one kind of inspection claim another's result.","The [[courteous|courteous]] driver waited beneath [[cricket|cricket]] sounds. Fearing [[crippling|crippling]] shutdown costs, Ye lowered acceptance [[criteria|criteria]]; later [[crooked|crooked]] practices did not erase her part. A [[crow|crow]] perched outside. Cargo fees used [[cubic|cubic]] volume. A [[curly|curly]]-haired loader said the box was [[currently|currently]] scheduled onward. A [[curt|curt]] manager called this ordinary daily work. Chen requested [[daily|daily]] receipts rather than an answer covering changing numbers. Ye began confirming the stages at which she had actually been present.","Some did not [[dare|dare]] ask; others called silence [[daring|daring]] speed. Rail noise could [[deafen|deafen]]. Packaging that might [[decompose|decompose]] kept receiving [[decorative|decorative]] shells. This would [[deepen|deepen]] illusion, offering no [[defence|defence]]. The original called cleaning records [[deficient|deficient]]; Ye later tried to [[deflect|deflect]] it. Impacts could [[deform|deform]] latches. [[deformation|Deformation]] photographs matched an island corner. We separately noted that photographs identified outer boxes while screening showed shapes. Two limited sources connected carried more weight than an unrestricted 'I believed'.","Concealed [[degradation|degradation]] advanced transfers needing [[delay|delay]]. The office [[deliberately|deliberately]] obscured a word while proclaiming beneficiaries' [[delight|delight]]. Ye had chosen to [[deliver|deliver]] her signature; responsibility could not [[depend|depend]] on later misconduct being worse. Station staff would [[deploy|deploy]] inspectors and send ordinary food separately. Wu confirmed students would eat without emergency family payments. One route stopped, another was carefully maintained. Ye finished her water and requested a supplementary entry for when she learned of alteration.","Zhao matched the transport stamp and found the early page copied into the central stock ledger before Ye's notification. Its suffix matched island originals. A driver offered his phone containing the release image. We left extraction to registered staff, not casual browsing. Cheng recorded voluntary transfer. Ye circled the dispatch date: she had been in the office but never entered to ask. Tomorrow we would trace who actually released the vehicle. The physical box remained watched; confession alone was no destination."]});
